{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-08_end",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-08",
  "title": "不做约定",
  "storyCode": "2-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5e04f4102eda605b713316a2ce11bc8542723d7a98388f93ae9a2cbb572de287",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "呼，呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "近卫局的护送队已经安全离开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "而敌人嘛——暂时也不打算放过我们的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "只要敌人还不知道米莎被近卫局接走，他们就越把注意力放在我们身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "这样的话，米莎那边就越安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "其实，为什么龙门和整合运动都要找这个孩子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不清楚，可能性很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我能想到的是，这孩子本人，或者只有她知情的什么东西......足以影响——甚至，左右龙门的安危。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "是的，也许是情报，也许是信息......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "所以龙门和整合运动，都想得到她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "——真是场危险的较量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不管是米莎、我们还是近卫局，都无法置身其外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "我们是不是被夹在很尴尬的位置啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "什么都不知道，又什么都要管......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不，不清楚呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "但陈长官那里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我有预感。事情不会这么简单就结束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "阿米娅，我们还有什么任务吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "需要我们陪同你回罗德岛吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不用了，现在我们战斗起来没有什么顾忌，应该是没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "如果是这样的话，我们就回去待命了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "接下来，希望你们能继续进行侦察活动，调查整合运动在龙门内渗透的具体情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我们虽然已经把米莎交给了近卫局，但整合运动......依然让我感到些许不安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "好说~那我们走了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "嗯，交给你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "大家，我们不知道还有多少整合运动在这里潜伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "做好准备，不要放松警惕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "接下来，我们将继续在高层建筑内部转移。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "必要的话，可以通过天台移动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "这样，我们能获得比在街头巷尾和整合运动缠斗更大的优势。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "有必要的话，我们也要引诱整合运动与我们作战，在我们的掌控下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干员们",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "一切都已安排妥当。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "该动身了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "进攻龙门对于整合运动，确实有战略性的意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "拿下龙门，整合运动能获得种种优势。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "但是风险与代价都很高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "——为什么那么执着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你看见那座建筑物了吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "我看得见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那是龙门的象征。也是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我回到这里，不仅是要夺回本属于感染者的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我还要让他——付出代价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "而且——你难道不觉得，这一切也很有趣吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "对吧，塔露拉——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
